  "title": "· New Bags | Louis Vuitton Debuts Men's Spring 2027 Collection: Ready for Any Weather ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Louis Vuitton 上市2027早春男士系列：无惧天气变幻",
  "excerpt": "Louis Vuitton's Spring 2027 men's pre-collection by Pharrell Williams blends weather-ready workwear with classic tailoring for travelers facing changing climates.",
