      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Louis Vuitton has just launched its Spring 2027 men's pre-collection, themed \"Whatever the Weather.\" Men's Creative Director Pharrell Williams drew inspiration from professional meteorologists reporting from the front lines, weaving workwear, raincoats, technical fabrics and other functional elements into classic gentlemanly dressing—creating a versatile wardrobe that lets travelers moving between continents and cities take shifting weather in stride.",
