    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Doudou Louis Raincoat plush bear wears a bright yellow raincoat, its leather ears playing off Monogram-patterned paws, with coated canvas foot pads and gleaming metal eyes and nose; the plush pile is irresistibly soft to the touch. The LV Louis Bear Rain bag charm sports a statement raincoat and bucket hat and clutches a dainty umbrella, dressed to face the storm in style. The LV Umbrella bag charm crafts a miniature umbrella in Monogram canvas and metal, accented with pearl-like raindrops 💧—a romantic, poetic nod to Paris in the rain.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
