    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Surplus Brut Denim ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This group of bags is crafted from Surplus Brut denim, with a laser process rendering a faded Monogram against a deep blue ground—its ghosted gradient texture echoing the trails left by running raindrops for striking visual depth. A new water-repellent treatment elevates the refined hand, while tonal calfskin trim adds a polished finish and an easy, elegant air. The new Walkaround Tote closes via hook clasps for quick access, offers roomy capacity that comfortably fits a laptop, and features extended top handles for comfortable carry. The line also includes the Speedy, the Keepall, the medium Jet Lag and the Flaneur backpack, among a rich array of shapes to suit every occasion.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
