      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Umbrella mini crossbody combines Monogram coated canvas with calfskin details, its clever design playing with trompe-l'œil effect; a side-zip main compartment holds everyday essentials like a phone, keys and cards, and the detachable, adjustable strap allows for shoulder or crossbody wear. The Nano Shopper Tote arrives in an ultra-petite 19.5x15x7.5cm size, its compact silhouette distilling the house's classic shopping-bag design and fitting a phone, small wallet and keys. The Take Out messenger is made in All Black calfskin, its minimalist lines projecting a cool, sharp attitude.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
